-- Assistant knowledge: the two prototype solutions added to the site (AI training platform, AI resume screener).
-- Idempotent: appends once, and only if the admin has not already written about them.
update public.godseye_settings
set knowledge = knowledge || $K$

Prototypes (built and demoed with the client, not yet live), both for a multi-plant automotive components group:
1. AI Induction Training Platform. A three-day new-joiner induction runs as avatar-led video modules in four languages (English, Hindi, Marathi, Tamil). An assistant answers questions only from the module script, by text or voice. A mid-module quiz pauses the video, a timed course exam needs 70% to pass, and a PDF certificate is issued on passing. Admins upload learners by CSV, manage a course library, and generate the exam from the course script (twenty questions), refine it in chat and publish. HR sees a compliance dashboard of who passed, who is overdue and who has not started. Built with OpenAI GPT-4o, Sarvam AI speech, PostgreSQL with pgvector, Express, Next.js and Google Cloud Run. No accuracy figure is published for it.
2. AI Hiring Screener. A recruiter writes a job description with qualifying criteria as fields (minimum education, minimum years, required languages with read and write, must-have skills, good-to-have skills) and uploads up to 25 resume PDFs. The model reads each PDF into a structured profile; a fixed-weight score (must-haves 40, good-to-haves 20, experience 20, education 10, languages 10) and a hard filter decide pass or fail; a second model call writes three strengths and three gaps. The recruiter reviews the parsed profile beside the PDF and shortlists or rejects. Shortlisted candidates are then rung by an AI interviewer that holds a first-round conversation in the candidate's language, briefed only on the job; every turn is transcribed with a timestamp, a summary and a score are written from the transcript, and the recruiter decides who meets a human. Only admins can start calls, only shortlisted candidates with a valid phone number are called, one live call per candidate. Built with Claude, Sarvam AI speech, a telephony bridge, PostgreSQL, Express and Next.js. No accuracy figure is published for it.
$K$
where id = 1 and knowledge not like '%AI Induction Training Platform%';
